            "review_text": "HosenTuananh\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia26 contributions\n0\nBeautiful Hotel & nice restaurant\nFeb 2014 • Business\nThis is my third times stay at this hotel , wonderful that i just know this restaurant name is Hanoi Boutique Club. I like this services as well as excellence staff. The food is authentic and very delicious\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 24, 2014\nHANOI BOUTIQUE HOTEL & SPA\nDear Mr. Hosen,\n\nThanks for choosing Hanoi Boutique and your kind words you reserved us. Hope you will be back and we can have chance to welcome you.\n\nHappy New Year to you and your family.\n\nHanoi Boutique Team\nRead more\nWritten February 12, 2015\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
